    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Structural Empathy.</strong> You can read stress lines in stone, welds, and people with the same part of your brain.</p><ul><li>You gain a small mechanical bonus on <strong>Investigation (Mind)</strong> or <strong>Perception (Mind)</strong> checks made to detect <strong>structural weaknesses, sabotage, or imminent failures</strong> in buildings, vehicles, and fortifications.</li><li>The GM may also let you sense social structures that are about to crack (factions on the verge of revolt, communities on the edge of panic) with similar rolls, often granting you advance warning before a collapse.</li></ul>",
